QU533Z.svg?dpl=3Ddpl_CEjisbLnWxFQGUTRjiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
<hr>
<p>To figure out how we branch out from here, let=E2=80=99s consider our de=
cision of whether to include or exclude an element. Let=E2=80=99s make this=
 decision with the first element of the input array, 4:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
img alt=3D"Image represents a diagram illustrating an inclusive and exclusi=
ve range operation.  A central node, labeled `[]`, represents the input ran=
