-3-HUSKCXIS.svg?dpl=3Ddpl_CEjisbLnWxFQGUTRjiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
<hr>
<p>Finally, for the third element, we continue branching out for each exist=
ing subset based on whether we include or exclude this element:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
img alt=3D"Image represents a binary tree illustrating a recursive algorith=
